lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected world full of unique locations made of memories. Travel through the tower of Arcane discovering its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a large set of special skills that you will be able to develop and customize as in a traditional RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592140/extras/e0912a41380a1cdbde71b714dc4c3fd2.poster.avif?t=1759488042\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592140/extras/e0912a41380a1cdbde71b714dc4c3fd2.webm?t=1759488042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Anima Project"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592140/44dde003227a979e2aecd307d1d030e0bd0b2a7a/header.jpg?t=1759488042","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Anima Gate of Memories is a trademark of Carlos B. Garc\u00eda. Developed by Anima Project and published by Anima Publishing. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3592140/1234200952/1a87f60de3fb366f72b292f199c0d73f8ed14976/1750464201/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748970912","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3592140/1234200952/1a87f60de3fb366f72b292f199c0d73f8ed14976/1750464201/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748970912","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3592140/1234200952/1a87f60de3fb366f72b292f199c0d73f8ed14976/1750464201/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748970912","id":257145951,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.